{"summary":"The buttons have come to life! Push, press, and twist your way to the goal!","description":"\"A rich and rewarding puzzler with a unique idea at its core\" - Pocket Gamer\n\nYOU ARE A BUTTON\nImagine the buttons popped out of your controllers and leapt right into the screen. That's the unique concept behind One More Button. You play as the adorable circle button. To move around, you have to press the arrow buttons scattered around the world.\n\nBRAIN-MELTING PUZZLES\n- Push, press, and twist your way to the goal!\n- Need to take a step back? The redo and undo buttons make retrying easy.\n\nIN A BEAUTIFUL HAND DRAWN WORLD\n- Explore a variety of mysterious worlds\n- Each packed with unique gimmicks and mechanics","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5excLQ7Hc7Q?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vjooQ3QeblEGT_KTlRFm_ng18QC4QLWOKuQQjqrV30stHmh2gpynOfo2Kx5iYc3voxH4XSIEeMf4PbLUSxgo2Q","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/l9zEoISL9Da41Cn-zUdwsaVX0oBgbmtH1FLT9npT8tCTI4OjClNvqHbcy75se5niLjr4JwtBTXpAEmlpKT6vvQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tCiyQf3v6Zs9xutMiyj-sLn9_Du0Xz5GqfQtlzDhPJCmsNg9RJtMY_U0NGmlLYJ8V1cvQjn5hv9TTCY3Sjv_","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/KOfJvXiNWyAZoeiDSEFgJFJvb42AC-muMhlF8VU74IuoqnjkU_M4sqebq-4RPvzA_Yo9x-3FSxh5bkulx7VO","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8S16O_mJs3d-yLZAaUyFTHMyLVDehhyRygdh-57i7CmoAXzF-NGzftTV1JKA1iIdYA29WWhTrp-7UUptCXE8","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qCQ1CEWtGWTsOb4pcQIhFg2GO9jl1TUfkPZ7FwmxiHjIr1ydiG-TY95C1tc5fkmALN8zTbhJqkS2HPvM5Yh2wg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/634HohxTmmA0TpCH9dpiXEMnS1IC4fT3WXW2i4oYsARtG30W7xAPGSK8xDBECIjOYlqASA0aUt4Ukr4KCRnqHbE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/S2DMG7kuX7NaakE1VCYRPZklBBen3djSHfZOtq81-UkTmxTg0zjMGzX_B7pNTfdSH1e0o4HdwLDTfgX_9kqVfdo","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/g2DM6NKkwHpjneKpp8p6tYAaAjDVn2JVHMGnymCINdCNQkgnl91